   "date": "2026-06-16",
   "title": "向島公園で第14回『むこうじまフェスタ』が開催！ふわふわ遊具に縁日ブースも！",
   "html": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"surround pink \">\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>こちらのイベントはすでに終了しています！</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">お子さま向けの楽しいイベントがいっぱい！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>高砂市<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">高砂町</span></strong>にある<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">向島公園</span></strong>の新芝生広場他で</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>恒例の第14回『 <span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">むこうじまフェスタ</span></strong></span> 』が開催されますよー！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"surround pink \">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">残念ながら雨予報のため『中止』となりました…。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>次回は8月開催予定、お楽しみに！</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"surround boader \">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■開催日時：<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">2026年 <span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">6月20日</span>（土）　<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">10:00〜15:00</span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■会場：<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">向島公園 新芝生広場ほか</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>来場者プレゼントで人気の<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">シール</span></strong>がもらえたり（数量限定・条件あり）、<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">縁日ブース</span></strong>や<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">ふわふわ遊具</span></strong>など、お子様向けのイベントがもりだくさん！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>他にも<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">キッズダンス</span></strong>や、<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">交通安全教室</span></strong>など、楽しく遊べて学べる1日を！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"voice l\"><div class=\"voice-box\"><div class=\"voice-l\"><p>もちろん恒例のキッチンカーや飲食ブースも多数出店で、大人の方も存分に楽しめます！</p></div></div><p class=\"img\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/nekoemon.png\">ねこえもん</p></div>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-22819\" src=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532.png\" alt=\"第14回むこうじまフェスタチラシ\" width=\"750\" height=\"1008\" srcset=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532.png 750w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532-223x300.png 223w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532-390x524.png 390w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532-250x336.png 250w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532-175x235.png 175w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532-150x202.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>すっかり<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">向島公園</span></strong>の恒例イベントとなった『<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">むこうじまフェスタ</span></strong>』も今回で<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">14回目</span></strong>の開催。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>今回も<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">縁日ブース</span></strong>に、<span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><strong>ふわふわ遊具</strong></span>、<strong><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/takasago_kidsspace/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">高砂キッズスペース</span></a></strong>さんのゲームコーナーなど、お子様向けのイベントが目白押し！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-15074\" src=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918.jpg\" alt=\"むこうじまフェスタスーパーボールすくい\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" srcset=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918.jpg 750w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918-300x300.jpg 300w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918-150x150.jpg 150w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918-390x390.jpg 390w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918-250x250.jpg 250w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050421918-175x175.jpg 175w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">（写真は過去に開催された時の模様です。）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>さらに<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">数量限定</span></strong>の人気の<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">シールプレゼント</span></strong>（条件あり）や、無料の<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">シャボン玉体験</span></strong>などワクワクがいっぱいです！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>また<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">キッズダンス</span></strong>や<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">交通安全教室</span></strong>（11:00~11:30）など、公園内の至る所で様々な催しも。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-15076\" src=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_.jpg\" alt=\"むこうじまフェスタヘッダー\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_.jpg 750w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_-300x200.jpg 300w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_-390x260.jpg 390w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_-250x167.jpg 250w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_-175x117.jpg 175w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PXL_20240518_050736110.MP_-150x100.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>もちろん今回も、各地域のイベントでお馴染みの<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">キ</span><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">ッチンカー</span></strong>や<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">フード屋台</span></strong>が多数出店されますので『うまいもん』も揃ってます！笑</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>『<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">遊ぶ</span></strong>・<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">学ぶ</span></strong>・<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">食べる</span></strong>』の3拍子が揃った『<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">むこうじまフェスタ</span></strong>』に、お子さま連れでぜひお越しくださいねー！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DV889wfEhGM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">この投稿をInstagramで見る</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DV889wfEhGM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KーNET(@k_net1001)がシェアした投稿</a></p>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>『<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">むこうじまフェスタ</span></strong>』のさらに詳しい情報は、こちらの<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mukoujimafesta/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">公式インスタグラム</a>を要チェック！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>最近は<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">ドッグラン</span></strong>や<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">トレーラーハウス</span></strong>（売店）がオープンしたりで、少しずつ賑わいを取り戻しつつある<strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">向島公園</span></strong>にぜひ遊びにきてくださいね！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"surround yellow \">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">過去（第9回）『むこうじまフェスタ』の様子はこちら&#x1f447;&#x1f447;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"【高砂イベント情報】豪華コラボ企画と人気のキッチンカー大集合！#shorts\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G8w3kWmIaY0\" width=\"356\" height=\"632\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>★<span class=\"keikou\"><strong>チャカさま、情報提供ありがとうございました！</strong></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><script src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9434776582952504\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><br />\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center;\" data-ad-layout=\"in-article\" data-ad-format=\"fluid\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9434776582952504\" data-ad-slot=\"9621449708\"></ins><br />\n<script>\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>イベントの情報</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-22820\" src=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2.png\" alt=\"第14回むこうじまフェスタヘッダー\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2.png 750w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2-300x200.png 300w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2-390x260.png 390w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2-250x167.png 250w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2-175x117.png 175w, https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot_20260609-0325532_2-150x100.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■<span class=\"keikou\"><strong>第14回 むこうじまフェスタ</strong></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■開催日時：2026年6月20日（土） 10:00〜15:00　※雨天中止（小雨決行）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■会場：向島公園　新芝生広場ほか：兵庫県高砂市高砂町向島町<br />\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: 0;\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3278.8586329097366!2d134.80089146515124!3d34.733957580426036!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3554d96df1b081ed%3A0x4e1f9cfe927a90c8!2z5ZCR5bO25YWs5ZyS77yI44Gf44GL44GV44GU44Om44OL44OQ44O844K144Or44OH44K244Kk44Oz44OX44Ot44K444Kn44Kv44OI77yJ!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1678334661119!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■駐車場：あり（約200台）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■最寄り駅：山陽電鉄本線高砂駅から徒歩30分</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>■公式インスタグラム：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mukoujimafesta/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/mukoujimafesta/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 10pt;\">※これらの情報は記事作成時のものです。最新の情報は公式サイトやSNSなどをチェックしてくださいね。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>★<span class=\"keikou\"><strong>向島公園（高砂海浜公園）の関連記事はこちら</strong></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"blog-card\"><a href=\"https://takasago-mania.com/spot-coco-mukoujima/\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"><img src='https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PXL_20260125_0418156492-150x100.jpg' alt='向島公園の新芝生広場にできたトレーラーハウス『coco むこうじま』でほっと一息…。' width=120 height=80 /></div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-content\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-title\">向島公園の新芝生広場にできたトレーラーハウス『coco むこうじま』でほっと一息…。 </div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-date\">2026-01-30</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"blog-card\"><a href=\"https://takasago-mania.com/spot-mukoujima-cage/\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"><img src='https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PXL_20260106_2307180172-150x100.jpg' alt='あれ！？向島公園にあった大型ケージが撤去されてる！この後はいったい何になるんやろ？' width=120 height=80 /></div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-content\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-title\">あれ！？向島公園にあった大型ケージが撤去されてる！この後はいったい何になるんやろ？ </div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-date\">2026-01-29</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"blog-card\"><a href=\"https://takasago-mania.com/news-mukoujima-mussy/\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"><img src='https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/20220717_135734-150x100.jpg' alt='向島公園に謎の未確認生物『ムッシー』が出現！？加古川河口付近で目撃情報多数！' width=120 height=80 /></div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-content\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-title\">向島公園に謎の未確認生物『ムッシー』が出現！？加古川河口付近で目撃情報多数！ </div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-date\">2022-07-17</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"blog-card\"><a href=\"https://takasago-mania.com/spot-mukoujima-sup/\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"><img src='https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_20240627_131121_677-150x100.jpg' alt='向島アウトドアパークで水上スポーツの新定番『SUP（サップ）』が気軽に体験できます！' width=120 height=80 /></div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-content\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-title\">向島アウトドアパークで水上スポーツの新定番『SUP（サップ）』が気軽に体験できます！ </div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-date\">2025-06-26</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"blog-card\"><a href=\"https://takasago-mania.com/spot-mukoujima-bbq/\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"><img src='https://takasago-mania.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_20240627_130854_167-150x100.jpg' alt='シーズン到来！向島アウトドアパークで白い砂浜と松の木の美しい海を眺めながらの絶景BBQ！' width=120 height=80 /></div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-content\">\n <div class=\"blog-card-title\">シーズン到来！向島アウトドアパークで白い砂浜と松の木の美しい海を眺めながらの絶景BBQ！ </div>\n <div class=\"blog-card-date\">2026-04-23</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
